  speakerName: VENDOR KYROS
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueText: 'Kalaw told me a new adventurer was exploring Vigan.

    When the
    morning has passed and the afternoon arrives, Ilocanos can greet someone by saying
    ''naimbag a malem.''

    It means ''good afternoon.''

    You can use it when
    greeting someone during the afternoon.

    Listen carefully: naimbag a malem.

    Now,
    try saying ''naimbag a malem'' yourself."

'
